ary/appendix-3-articles-of-the-church-of-christ-june-1829\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/appendix-3-articles-of-the-church-of-christ-june-1829\" poptitle=\"Appendix 3: “Articles of the Church of Christ,” June 1829\">“Articles of the Church of Christ,” June 1829</a>.)</p><hr></div></div></aside><span class=\"josephswriting\"> and if we walk in newness of life to the </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">end of this probation at the day of accounts we Shall </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">be caught up in clouds to meet the Lord in the air</span><aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"2532093306338916712\"><a href=\"#2532093306338916712\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans6\"><span id=\"documenttrans6\">6</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\">See 1 Thessalonians 4:17.</p><hr></div></div></aside><span class=\"josephswriting\"> </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">but I need not undertake to write of the goodness of God </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">for his goodness is unspeakable ne</span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">i</span>]<span class=\"josephswriting\">ther tell of the mite</span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">ries </span>[<span class=\"josephswriting\">mysteries</span>]<span class=\"josephswriting\"> of God for what is man that he can comprehend </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">and Search out the wisdom of deity for Great is the misteries </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">of Godliness</span><aside class=\"popup-wrapper\" id=\"15013182766249393256\"><a href=\"#15013182766249393256\" class=\"editorial-note-static staticPopup\" title=\"Note\" name=\"trans7\"><span id=\"documenttrans7\">7</span></a><div class=\"popup-content\"><div class=\"note-data editorial-footnote\" isnote=\"Y\"><p class=\"bottom_0\"> See 1 Timothy 3:16.</p><hr></div></div></aside><span class=\"josephswriting\"> therefore my only motive in this writing is to </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">inform you of my prospects and hopes and my desires and </span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">my long</span>&lt;​<span class=\"josephswriting\">ing</span>​&gt;<span class=\"josephswriting\"> to be freed from Sin and to rest in the king</span><span class=\"line-break\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"></span><span class=\"josephswriting\">dom of my Savior and my redeemer when I </span> [p. 7]</div></body></html>", "calendarsOfDocuments": [], "versions": [{"versionTitle": "Letter from Oliver Cowdery, 6 November 1829", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letter-from-oliver-cowdery-6-november-1829/1", "versionFeatured": "true"}, {"versionTitle": "Letterbook 1", "versionLink": "/paper-summary/letterbook-1/18", "versionFeatured": ""}], "images": {"smallImageUrl": "/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007_thumb.jpg", "mediumImageUrl": "/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007_med.jpg", "largeImageUrl": "/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007.jpg", "downloadImageUrl": "/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007_download.jpg"}, "imageCredit": "", "facsimile": "", "dzUrlXml": "/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007.xml", "classification": "Documents", "publishedStatus": "FinalContent", "accessionNumber": "25", "requestedPageNumber": "2", "numberOfPages": "3", "editorialTitle": "Letter from Oliver Cowdery, 6 November 1829", "cleanEditorialTitle": "Letter from Oliver Cowdery, 6 November 1829", "date": "November 6, 1829", "handwriting": "Handwriting of JS", "footnotes": [{"id": "4899630968547584394", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\">This passage includes several phrases that are not found in the Bible but appear in the <a href=\"/paper-summary/book-of-mormon-1830\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/book-of-mormon-1830\" poptitle=\"Book of Mormon, 1830\">Book of Mormon</a>. The phrase “conditions of repentance” appears in the Book of Mormon multiple times and was also included in a <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-june-1829-b-dc-18\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-june-1829-b-dc-18\" poptitle=\"Revelation, June 1829–B [D&amp;C\n18]\">revelation</a> addressed to <a href=\"/person/oliver-cowdery\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Cowdery</a> the previous June.<span class=\"toe-note\" href=\"#toe-notea\">a</span> The phrase “great and last sacrifice” occurs three times in the Book of Mormon—all on the same page of the 1830 edition. This same page includes the phrase “infinite atonement.”<span class=\"toe-note\" href=\"#toe-noteb\">b</span> According to Cowdery’s postscript at the end of the letter, he had only recently transcribed this passage in his creation of the printer’s manuscript. The phrase “eternal Father of Heaven and of Earth” appears twice in the Book of Mormon.<span class=\"toe-note\" href=\"#toe-notec\">c</span>)</p></body></html>", "number": 4, "type": "number", "toenote": "<sup>a</sup>Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=276\" class=\"externalLink\">270</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=344\" class=\"externalLink\">338</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=424\" class=\"externalLink\">418</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=452\" class=\"externalLink\">446</a> [Alma 17:15; 42:13; Helaman 5:11; 14:11, 18]; <a href=\"/paper-summary/revelation-june-1829-b-dc-18\" class=\"reference\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/revelation-june-1829-b-dc-18\" poptitle=\"Revelation, June 1829–B [D&amp;C\n18]\">Revelation, June 1829–B</a> [D&amp;C 18:12]. <sup>b</sup>Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=325\" class=\"externalLink\">319</a> [Alma 34:10–14]. <sup>c</sup>Book of Mormon, 1830 ed., <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=192\" class=\"externalLink\">186</a>, <a href=\"/paperSummary/book-of-mormon-1830?p=259\" class=\"externalLink\">253</a> [Mosiah 15:4; Alma 11:39].", "longcitation": null}, {"id": "14287927361718448468", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\">See Romans 6:4. A number of JS’s friends and supporters in the vicinity of <a href=\"/place/palmyra-township-new-york\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Palmyra</a> and <a href=\"/place/fayette-township-new-york\" class=\"referenceInPop\">Fayette</a> townships in New York had already been baptized. (See <a href=\"/paper-summary/appendix-3-articles-of-the-church-of-christ-june-1829\" class=\"referenceInPop\" pop=\"/ajax/papers/tooltip/appendix-3-articles-of-the-church-of-christ-june-1829\" poptitle=\"Appendix 3: “Articles of the Church of Christ,” June 1829\">“Articles of the Church of Christ,” June 1829</a>.)</p></body></html>", "number": 5, "type": "number", "toenote": "", "longcitation": null}, {"id": "2532093306338916712", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\">See 1 Thessalonians 4:17.</p></body></html>", "number": 6, "type": "number", "toenote": "", "longcitation": null}, {"id": "15013182766249393256", "text": "<html><head></head><body><p class=\"bottom_0\"> See 1 Timothy 3:16.</p></body></html>", "number": 7, "type": "number", "toenote": "", "longcitation": null}], "meta": {"/paper-summary-PageTitle": "Letter from Oliver Cowdery, 6 November 1829, Page 7", "/paper-summary-MetaTitle": "Letter from Oliver Cowdery, 6 November 1829, Page 7", "/paper-summary-MetaDescription": "the most to learn of your faithfulness in christ my dear Brother when I think of the goodness of chr...", "/paper-summary-MetaUrl": "/paper-summary/letter-from-oliver-cowdery-6-november-1829/2", "/paper-summary-MetaImage": "/bc-jsp/content/jsp/images/25/25_ms155_2_01_lb1_007_thumb.jpg"}, "scribes": [{"id": "per46", "name": "Joseph Smith Jr."}], "printVolumeLocation": "<a href=\"http://www.josephsmithpapers.org/publishedVolumes/documents-volume-1-july-1828-june-1831\" class=\"externalLink\" xmlns:srchdoc=\"https://ldsc.xmlref.com/local/ldschurch/searchDocuments\" xmlns:lds=\"https://ldsc.xmlref.com/local/ldschurch\"><span class=\"title\">JSP,</span> D1:98–101</a>"}, "legal": {}, "disableVerticalScroll": true, "documentURI": "/published/jsp/searchable/papers/26049/26049-0002.xml", "searchOptions": [{"name": "| This Document", "value": "document"}, {"name": "| Full Site", "value": "site"}]}